  1978                              <1> ; ---- the interpreter's variables, after the code (zero at the start) -------
  1979                              <1> ; They are in the zeros that pad the section to its FileAlignment, or past
  1980                              <1> ; them in the uninitialised part: within 127 bytes of `next` either way.
  1981                              <1>         absolute rawend
